{
  "name": "Send new security agent onboarding checklist with Gmail and Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -580,
        -147
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 420,
        "height": 1380,
        "content": "## Send New Security Agent Onboarding Checklist\n\nEvery morning, this workflow checks your agent roster for newly added agents, sends each one a comprehensive onboarding checklist email with required documents and first steps, and marks them as Onboarding in the sheet — so no new hire slips through the cracks.\n\n### How it works\n\n1. **Every Day 09:00** fires the workflow on a daily schedule.\n2. **Configure** holds all user-facing settings (sheet URL, company name, HR email).\n3. **Read Agent Roster** fetches all rows from your agent database.\n4. **Capture Row Index** assigns each row a unique index for the status update.\n5. **Filter New Agents** keeps only rows where Status = New.\n6. **Send Onboarding Email** delivers a checklist email to each new agent.\n7. **Update Agent Status** marks the agent row as Onboarding in the sheet.\n\n### Setup\n\n1. Connect your **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential.\n2. Connect your **Gmail OAuth2** credential.\n3. In the **Configure** node, update `sheetUrl`, `companyName`, and `hrEmail`.\n4. Ensure your agent sheet has columns: Agent_Name, Email, Status, Start_Date.\n5. Set Status to **New** when a new agent is added.\n6. Activate the workflow.\n\n### Customization\n\n- Edit the checklist items in the **Send Onboarding Email** body.\n- Add a Start_Date condition to only send when Start_Date is within 3 days.\n- CC HR by adding a `cc` field with the `hrEmail` variable."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "Trigger & Configure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -60,
        -147
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 720,
        "height": 367,
        "content": "## Trigger & Configure\n\nFires every morning at 09:00. Configure holds the sheet URL, company name, and HR email for the onboarding communication."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "Read & Index",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        740,
        -128
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 720,
        "height": 348,
        "content": "## Read & Index\n\nFetches all agents from the roster. Assigns each row a unique index used to update Status after sending."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "Filter & Send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1540,
        -128
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 1120,
        "height": 348,
        "content": "## Filter & Send\n\nKeeps only agents with Status = New. Sends each one a personalized onboarding checklist. Updates the sheet Status to Onboarding."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "Every Day 09:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.3
    },
    {
      "name": "Configure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        400,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-sheet",
              "name": "sheetUrl",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SHEET_ID_HERE/edit"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-company",
              "name": "companyName",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your Security Company"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-hr",
              "name": "hrEmail",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "user@example.com"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "name": "Read Agent Roster",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        800,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "read",
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": 0
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "={{ $('Configure').first().json.sheetUrl }}"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.7
    },
    {
      "name": "Capture Row Index",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "row-idx",
              "name": "row_number",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $itemIndex + 2 }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "name": "Filter New Agents",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "position": [
        1600,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 3,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-new",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.Status }}",
              "rightValue": "New"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.3
    },
    {
      "name": "Send Onboarding Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "position": [
        2000,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.Email }}",
        "message": "={{ \"<html><body style=\\\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\\\"><p>Hello <strong>\" + $json.Agent_Name + \"</strong>,</p><p>Welcome to <strong>\" + $('Configure').first().json.companyName + \"</strong>! Here is your onboarding checklist to complete before your start date (\" + $json.Start_Date + \"):</p><ol><li>Submit a copy of your valid <strong>CNAPS card</strong></li><li>Provide your <strong>APS / SSIAP certificate</strong></li><li>Complete the company <strong>health and safety form</strong></li><li>Provide a copy of your <strong>national ID</strong></li><li>Sign and return your <strong>employment contract</strong></li><li>Confirm your <strong>bank details</strong> for payroll setup</li></ol><p>Please send all documents to <a href=\\\"mailto:\" + $('Configure').first().json.hrEmail + \"\\\">\" + $('Configure').first().json.hrEmail + \"</a>.</p><p>Looking forward to working with you.</p></body></html>\" }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        },
        "subject": "={{ \"Welcome to \" + $('Configure').first().json.companyName + \" — Your onboarding checklist\" }}",
        "resource": "message",
        "emailType": "html",
        "operation": "send"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "name": "Update Agent Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        2400,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "columns": {
          "value": {
            "Status": "Onboarding",
            "row_number": "={{ $('Filter New Agents').item.json.row_number }}"
          },
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "matchingColumns": [
            "row_number"
          ]
        },
        "options": {},
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "update",
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": 0
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "={{ $('Configure').first().json.sheetUrl }}"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.7
    }
  ],
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
